<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="en-US"><voice name="en-CA-ClaraNeural">Number two.<break time="1350ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural">I signed up for the beginner yoga class that meets on Wednesday evenings.<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-GB-RyanNeural">That class has moved to Thursday because the instructor is attending a training course. The starting time is still seven.<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural">Thursday works for me. Do I need to register again at the front desk?<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-GB-RyanNeural">No, your name is already on the new list. Just bring the same membership card.<break time="1300ms"/></voice><voice name="en-CA-ClaraNeural">Question.<break time="350ms"/></voice><voice name="en-CA-ClaraNeural">What is true about the yoga class?</voice></speak>
